2026-09-25T00:00:29Z (RFD66606-2256) '1. The signer guest starts, logs in to Bao with its own cert
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2256  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-25T00:00:30Z (RFD66606-2256) '   identity over mTLS terminated inside the guest, and reads the
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2256  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-25T00:00:31Z (RFD66606-2256) '   app key into guest memory.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2256  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-25T00:00:32Z (RFD66606-2256) '2. An agent's guest opens a WebTransport session to the zone
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2256  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-25T00:00:33Z (RFD66606-2256) '   server on UDP 7443 and sends a mint request naming itself.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2256  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-25T00:00:34Z (RFD66606-2256) '3. The signer checks `agent:<cn>#mint@app:<app>` in the
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2256  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-25T00:00:35Z (RFD66606-2256) '   relationship store and refuses without it.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2256  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-25T00:00:36Z (RFD66606-2256) '4. It signs a JWT, exchanges it for an installation token over
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2256  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-25T00:00:37Z (RFD66606-2256) '   TLS inside the guest, and returns the token and its expiry.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2256  1 LINE
 Text:Written

